"读取 iPhone 上已经报给 Last.fm 的播放记录：Mac 没有播放时会推给「网页推送」显示「iPhone 正在播」（这台 Mac 本地的悬浮歌词只读本机播放状态，不受影响）；打开下面的开关还会把这些记录转发进 ListenBrainz，统一两台设备的播放历史，这也需要「ListenBrainz」账号绑定好。" = "Reads the playback history your iPhone has already reported to Last.fm. When the Mac itself isn't playing anything, this is pushed to \"Web Push\" to show \"Now playing on iPhone\" (this Mac's own floating lyrics only read local playback and aren't affected). Turning on the switch below also forwards these plays into ListenBrainz to unify listening history across both devices, which also requires the \"ListenBrainz\" account to be connected.";
